{"title":"1994 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Show that every natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8ed70d0a200bcababa2ecc0a5fc848df10de91d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le 2^{1,000,000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"19\" /> can be obtained after 1 by doing less than 1,100,000 additions; more precisely, there is a finite sequence of natural numbers\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e93684163d173bf7ca9c971278a06750d0b5b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_0, x_1, \\cdots , x_k \\; \\text{with }\\; k \\le 1,100,000,\\; x_0=1,\\; x_k=n,\\]\" width=\"402\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>such that for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/1/6316836c95c1c8ac81a200a662ccfa7fb0e2935a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=1,2, \\cdots ,k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />, there exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/6/93652ee02ca39eeb728f43b3b0fd6bdfb6bcec25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le r &lt; i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea50a23ee49f2b022ba8b94e94eaf330fcb6441.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/7/637300d6bb6aa1d8875b83ac0cfb4292453fadc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79f081fa9774c9a0ed7d25d9791a55403977723c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i=x_r+x_s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1994_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe9.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe9.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016223459\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expa